    "body": "> Bear with me; this is my first foray into Rust.\r\n\r\nWell, welcome aboard the ship! It's got some problems with `await` but it's fun nonetheless.\r\n\r\nThe code overall looks pretty good to me! A few stylistic quibbles, but no major problems pop out. I'm sure @matchai will be happy to finally have this onboard.\r\n\r\nOne issue I ran into (not sure if you can replicate it) is that if I start fish without vi mode, the prompt is permanently stuck using the normal-mode symbol. I can't seem to get it to switch over. Based on what I see in the code, it seems like either a problem with fish or the interface between fish and starship, but I'm not a fish user, so I don't know how else to troubleshoot it.",
